PET dataset v1.1 in this repository
===================================

Source:   https://huggingface.co/datasets/patriziobellan/PET
          (dataset card at revision 5eb9bca5c7dc850b2a42df268b78b88190ab2466,
          last modified 2023-07-05; checked 2026-11-20)
Paper:    P. Bellan, C. Ghidini, M. Dragoni, S. P. Ponzetto, H. van der Aa,
          "Process Extraction from Natural Language Text: the PET Dataset and
          Annotation Guidelines", NL4AI 2022, CEUR Workshop Proceedings 3287,
          pp. 177-191, https://ceur-ws.org/Vol-3287/paper18.pdf
Licence:  MIT, as the dataset card's metadata declares it ("license: mit").
          The card's "Licensing Information" section is empty and names no
          copyright holder, so none is given here.

Files of this repository that are PET or derived from it:
  pet_data/PETv1.1-relations.json   PET v1.1's relations file, as distributed
  pet_train.json, pet_test.json     its training and held-out splits, converted
  text2bpmn/baselines/train_315.json, dev_split.json, dev_split_definition.json,
  text2bpmn/baselines/pet_jobs.json and the predicted-span files under
  text2bpmn/baselines/               sentences and spans of PET
  runs/ (the PET documents' folders) the pipeline's outputs on PET's texts

